          "settings": {
            "question": "Do your perfumes smell the same as the designer fragrances they're inspired by?",
            "answer": "<p>Our perfumes are <strong>inspired by popular designer fragrances</strong> and have a <strong>scent profile that goes in the same direction.</strong> Many customers say our scents <strong>remind them of</strong> their favorite perfumes, but they remain unique interpretations — never the original fragrances.</p><p>We use <strong>high-quality fragrance oils</strong> from European suppliers to create a luxury scent experience, without the high designer brand price.</p>"
